How TO use the BTREE

A Btree generally has the following properties :
      1. data in a particular node
      2. The order of the BTree ( the number of children in each node )

In our implementation we have the following structure...
     1. THE data in the Btree ==>[ key , value ]
     2. THe order of the Btree is a simple integer

Here both the key and the value can be of any type as both are templates

So the creation of a variable is the following :

BTREE< keyType , ValueType, order >object ( key_iterator_begin , key_iterator_end , value_iterator_begin , value_iterator_end )

Please look into the definition of the BTREE class ( derived from __BTREE__ )
to find the interface supported.

Please do add other functionalities... :-)
KEYNOTE : Please adhere with the STL concepts before adding new functionalities

Thanks..
